  "goodToKnow": "Der Krieger (die Kriegerin) is a warrior, a somewhat old-fashioned or epic word: die Krieger der Wikinger. A modern soldier is der Soldat. Almost every German village has a Kriegerdenkmal, a memorial to the soldiers who fell in the world wars. Kriegerisch means warlike: kriegerische Auseinandersetzungen (armed conflicts). From der Krieg (war). Plural: die Krieger."
